  "Drag the four corners to the picture's own corners, inside the film's edge and the holder. The frame is then measured on all of that and nothing around it, whatever it is cropped to.": "把四个角拖到画面自身的四角，位于胶片边缘与片夹之内。此后无论怎么裁切，测量都覆盖全部画面区域及其周边之外的内容。",
  "Drag the four corners to the picture's own corners, inside the film's edge and the holder. The frame is then measured on all of that and nothing around it, whatever it is cropped to. Without an area it is measured on the middle of the cropped frame, a tenth left out at each edge. Measure the roll again after changing it.": "把四个角拖到画面自身的四角，位于胶片边缘与片夹之内。此后无论怎么裁切，测量都覆盖全部画面区域及其周边之外的内容。不设区域时，测量落在裁切后画面的中央，各边各留出十分之一。改动之后请重新测量整卷。",
  "Draw a rectangle over clear film: the film's edge, or the gap between two frames. The clearest film in it is taken, so it need not keep the picture or the edge print out. Keep sprocket holes and the bare light past the film outside it.": "在透明片基上画一个矩形：胶片边缘，或两帧之间的空隙。会取其中最深清澈的部分，所以不必避开画面或边缘印字。齿孔与胶片之外的空光请留在矩形之外。",
