  "HDR Highlights": "HDR 高光",
  "HDR preserves brighter highlights on compatible displays. Choose Standard for wider compatibility. It applies to HEIC exports of films that deliver HDR, without a print frame.": "HDR 可在兼容显示器上保留更亮的高光。若需更广兼容性请选择标准；它适用于会输出 HDR 的胶片的 HEIC 导出，且不带印相边框。",
  "How strong the scan's densities read. Every density over the clear film is multiplied by it before the film is read, so the picture gains or loses contrast in every colour alike and its balance and exposure follow. Raise it where a scan prints flat, as a camera or a light the reading only guesses at can; lower it where it prints hard. 100% is the scan as it measures.": "扫描密度读得有多强。读出胶片之前，透明片基之上的每个密度都乘以它，于是画面各色一同增减反差，平衡与曝光随之而动。扫描出来发平的（相机或光源只能靠猜的情形）可提高；发硬的则可降低。100% 即扫描的实测状态。",
