  "The light behind the film. A phone or tablet screen and separate red, green and blue LEDs light the film in narrower bands than a white panel or a halogen lamp, which changes how much of each dye every channel sees.": "胶片背后的光源。手机或平板屏幕、彼此分离的红绿蓝 LED 比白光面板或卤素灯以更窄的波段照亮胶片，这会改变每个通道看到每种染料的多少。",
