  "This negative was saved with an earlier reading of its scan and prints as it did. Update it to read the film through the scan's light and camera: its colours will change, and Undo brings them back.": "该负片保存时用的是较早的扫描读数，因此仍按旧读数成像。更新后会按扫描光源与相机来读取胶片：色彩将随之改变，撤销即可恢复。",
  "This restores Fotufilm’s original settings. Your photos and edits will not change.": "恢复 Fotufilm 的初始设置。您的照片与编辑不会改变。",
