  "Use on Every Frame of the Roll": "应用于整卷每一帧",
  "Variable fps": "可变帧率",
  "viewer canvas": "查看器画布",
  "What the frame's colour is balanced on. Roll uses what the roll's frames come to taken together, measured in the Roll panel, so a frame filled by one colour keeps it and an evening stays warmer than a noon. Frame uses the frame's own tones, or a neutral picked on it. None leaves the film as it reads. A measured roll starts on Roll.": "画幅的色彩平衡依据。「整卷」采用整卷各帧合起来的测量结果（在「整卷」面板中测量），因此被单一颜色占满的一帧仍保持该色，傍晚仍比正午更暖。「本帧」使用本帧自己的色调，或在其上点选的中性点。「无」则保留胶片的原始读数。已测量的整卷会以「整卷」起步。",
  "What took the scan. Auto reads a camera RAW through its own camera's measured colour channels where the camera is one of those measured, and any other file as a generic camera. Choose Film Scanner for a scan from a dedicated film scanner.": "扫描来源。自动会按相机的实测色彩通道读取相机 RAW（该相机属于已实测机型时），其他文件按通用相机处理。若扫描来自专用底片扫描仪，请选择「胶片扫描仪」。",
  "You have Fotufilm {0}. The update arrives as a signed installer, like the one this copy was installed from. Installing may ask for your administrator password.": "您当前是 Fotufilm {0}。更新以已签名的安装程序形式发布，与本副本的安装方式相同。安装时可能会要求管理员密码。",
  "You're up to date": "已是最新版本",
